  "content": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">세<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>개 데<ruby style=\"position: relative\">읻<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">뎽<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sXirCehYlh0?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人生<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">띤솅ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">風景<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">헝ˉ곙`</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">親像<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">친ˉ츌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">大海<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">돠해`</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">風湧<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">헝ˉ옝`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    rin-siêng’e hōng-kièng, chīn-chiṵ-toa-hài’e hōng-yèng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">우時<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">우시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">猛<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">뼹`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">우時<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">우시ˊ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">平<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">볭ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">親愛<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">친ˉ애</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">朋友<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">볭유`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> 됴<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">小心<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쇼ˆ심ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    u-sí bièng u-sí piéng, chīn-ai pieng-yù lì tio-siô-sîm\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人生<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">띤솅ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">環境<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">환곙`</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">乞食<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">킫ˆ쟣ˆ</rt></ruby> 마에<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">出頭天<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">춛ˆᄐᅷ틸ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    rin-siêng’e hoan-kièng, khît-jiâh ma-e-chût-thau-thḭ̂\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    뽀<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">怨天<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">완`틸ˆ</rt></ruby> 뽀<span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">尤人<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">유띤ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">命<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">먀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">順<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">순ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">命<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">먀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">빼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一生<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">읻ˆ솅ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bo-oàn-thḭ̂ bo-yu-rín, mia-sūn mia-bài lông-si-ît-siêng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一杯<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">酒<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">쥬`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">兩角<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">능각ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">銀<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">끤ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">三不五時<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1em\">삼ˉ붇ˆ꺼시ˊ</rt></ruby> 마<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">鬥陣<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄃᅷ`딘ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jit-puē-jiù nng-kâk-gín, sām-pût-gor-sí ma-lai-tàu-tīn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">나ˉ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">跋<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">봫-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">感情<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">世界<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">세`개</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">第一等<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.1em\">데읻ˆ뎽`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    na-bêh-kông-poah-kâm-jiéng, goà si-sè-kai’e te-ît-tièng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">緣分<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">옌훈ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">註定<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">주`뎽ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">好漢<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">호ˆ한</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">破腹<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">퐈`박</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">相見<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">살ˉ길</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    si-yen-hūn si-jù-tiēng, hô-han phoà-pak lai-sā̰-kḭ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    음<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">驚<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">걀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">風<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">헝ˆ</rt></ruby> 음<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">驚<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">걀ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">湧<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">옝`</rt></ruby>,</span> 우<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">情<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">졩ˊ</rt></ruby> 우<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">義<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">끼ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">好<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">호ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">兄弟<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">햘ˉ디ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    m-kiā̰-hông m-kiā̰-yèng, u-jiéng u-gī hô-hiā̰-tī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">短短<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">데ˆ데ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">仔<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">아`</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">光陰<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">겅ˉ임ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">칟<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">토<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˏ</rt></ruby> 됴<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">趁<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">탄`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">少年<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄉᆤ`롄-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">時<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">시ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tê-tê-à’e kōng-îm, chît-thó tio-thàn-siàu-lien-sí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">求<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">규-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">名利<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뼹리ˉ</rt></ruby> 뽀<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">了<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">ᄅᆤˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">時<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">시ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">千金<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쳰ˉ김ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">難<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">란-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">買<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뾔ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">好<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">호ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人生<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">띤솅ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\